---
layout: workspace.njk
title: Project breakout
screen: costs
subtitle: N819 · Cost category analysis
---
<nav class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4" aria-label="Project cost views">
  <a href="{{ '/project-info/N819/' | url }}">Project information</a>
  <a href="{{ '/costs/cost-summary/' | url }}">Cost summary</a>
  <a href="{{ '/costs/to-date-costs/' | url }}">Cost transactions</a>
  <a href="{{ '/project-costs/breakout/' | url }}">Category breakout</a>
  <a href="{{ '/plans/' | url }}">Plans</a>
</nav>
<p class="text-body-secondary mb-4">Sample categories reconcile to the N819 costs-to-date figure. Remaining budget is a cost baseline calculation, not profit.</p>
<div class="card">
  <div class="table-responsive" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Project N819 category breakout">
    <table class="table table-striped table-hover align-middle">
      <caption class="visually-hidden">Project N819 category breakout</caption>
      <thead class="table-dark">
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Code</th>
          <th scope="col">Category</th>
          <th scope="col" class="text-end">Sample budget</th>
          <th scope="col" class="text-end">Actual costs</th>
          <th scope="col" class="text-end">Remaining budget</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>{% for item in samples.categories %}
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">{{ item.code }}</th>
          <td>{{ item.name }}</td>
          <td class="text-end">{{ item.budget | money }}</td>
          <td class="text-end">{{ item.actual | money }}</td>
          <td class="text-end">{{ item.remaining | money }}</td>
        </tr>{% endfor %}
        <tr>
          <th scope="row" colspan="2">Total</th>
          <td class="text-end">{{ samples.totals.budget | money }}</td>
          <td class="text-end">{{ samples.totals.actual | money }}</td>
          <td class="text-end">{{ (samples.totals.budget - samples.totals.actual) | money }}</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="card bg-body mt-4">
  <div class="card-body">
    <h2 class="h5">Review guidance</h2>
    <p class="mb-0">Compare actual costs with the cost baseline, then inspect the transaction sample for a category. The sample does not include committed costs or a forecast to complete.</p>
  </div>
</section>
